---- PART B: rank genes instead of thresholding them ----
Ranking by the recentred t-statistic, which is both offset-free and precision-weighted.
A constant offset does not change the ORDER of logFC, but it does change the order of t,
because t divides by a gene-specific SE. So the ranking is taken after recentring.

